 recorded two observations that don't block anything:\n- LLR-207's list of test cases doesn't include TC-424, though TC-424 does name LLR-207 as what it verifies.\n- One LLR-368 sentence about rebases says \"earlier marks and attestations are not judged\". That repeats an earlier clause and is loosely worded. The rebase test fixes its reading, and a later pass could tighten it.\n\nI ran no test suites; this sitting rules on text."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":475,"cache_read_input_tokens":499965,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":475},"output_tokens":734,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"62488e29-4f8f-46dc-a1ab-0647d367ffcd","uuid":"781ad624-0b81-41ba-be24-5954fbec8040","timestamp":"2026-11-08T04:48:20.455Z","request_id":"req_011CgpraxkzAhdFTZ2FauBjx"}
